# Active MCP config: not tracked so a fresh checkout never auto-mounts (and
# `pnpm dlx`-executes) a third-party server on `make run`. Copy the tracked
# `.mcp.json.example` to `.mcp.json`, or use `pyharness-mcp add`, to activate one.
